# tests
#
# This repository holds the mod. The test scaffolding - unit tests, the Fabric client game tests,
# and the per-loader harnesses - is kept alongside it on the machines that run it, not shipped with
# the source. Each piece carries its own build wiring, and the tracked build files do nothing at all
# when it is absent.

local-tests.gradle
**/harness.gradle
**/src/test/
**/src/gametest/
**/src/harness/
